@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:build] pinned-source-inputs
Production packages and test tooling MUST use immutable locked sources and
hash-verified dependencies. Dependency installation MUST NOT be described as
proof of runtime behavior. Unsupported Nix versions MUST fail explicitly.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:verification] native-behavior-evidence
Tests MUST exercise the actual C++ implementation. Claims about Nix execution
MUST use the real patched CLI; passing core tests alone MUST NOT establish daemon,
remote-protocol, TTY, signal or NixOS integration behavior.

@cc [owner:ghuntley,label:integration] independent-flake-consumption
The default package and exported modules MUST be consumable without any original
monorepo checkout. The NixOS module MUST require explicit enablement. Package
factories MUST validate their supported Nix version before patching.
